{"ticker":{"symbol":"092790.KS","name":"넥스틸","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":8880.0,"change_pct":-0.09939148073022308,"market_cap":230897762304.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.13006756756756757,"week52_low":8850.0,"week52_high":23000.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","country":"South Korea","city":"Pohang","employees":401,"website":"https://www.nexteel.co.kr","business_summary":"NEXTEEL Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells steel pipes in South Korea and internationally. It offers casing and tubing pipes for oil well boring and oil production; line pipes for oil, gas, and water transportation in oil and gas industry; carbon steel pipes for structural and mechanical purpose, as well as skelp pipes. The company also offers colored square pipes and steel pipes for civil, architecture, and other structure. The company was formerly known as Daewon Industrial Co., Ltd. and changed its name to NEXTEEL Co., Ltd. in April 2001. NEXTEEL Co., Ltd. was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Pohang, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"넥스티엘(주)는 국내 및 해외에 강관을 제조, 판매하고 있습니다. 유정 천공 및 석유 생산을 위한 케이싱 및 튜빙 파이프를 제공합니다. 석유 및 가스 산업의 석유, 가스 및 수자원 운송용 라인 파이프; 구조용 및 기계용 탄소강 파이프와 스켈프 파이프. 이 회사는 또한 토목, 건축 및 기타 구조물용 컬러 사각 파이프와 강관을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 대원산업(주)로 알려졌으며 2001년 4월에 넥스티엘(주)로 사명을 변경했습니다. 넥스티엘(주)는 1990년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 포항에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"금속 제조","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":668403649810.0,"operating_income":181300505120.0,"net_income":144193113550.0,"eps":6028.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":619052056910.0,"operating_income":157337246680.0,"net_income":129580237650.0,"eps":5469.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":552365337640.0,"operating_income":63204878090.0,"net_income":34757744980.0,"eps":1334.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":550992457550.0,"oper